I'm sure all of you have had something similar or equally bizarre happen to
them but I just had to post this to share in the amusement.

I'm playing a Monk and I'm on Dungeon Lvl 7 when a wraith moves into my room. 
Worried about loosing levels I look through my inventory to see if I have
anything I can zap him with.  I randomly choose a wand I haven't used yet or
identified and pray it works.  It turns out to be a wand of wishing!  
I wish for (of course) a +2 blessed rustproof Snickersnee and immediately kill
the wraith with it.  I try the Wand of wishing again...
Another wish!  I ask for a blessed spellbook of identify (what other good loot
am I carrying around?) 
I manage to get one more wish out of it so I ask for a blessed figurine of an
Archon.
When I get him he's holding Demonbane.  We (the Archon my pet dog and I) all
proceed to Dungeon Lvl 8 and happen upon a huge Leprecan Hall.
I wait outside and the Archon begins to smite all the Leprecans and the dog
eats all the corpses.  I end up cleaning up after them and pick up 10,869 in
gold. 
We head to the next level and a Master Lich is waiting for us.  He gets killed
too but not before polymorphing my pet dog into a Bone Devil.
it keeps getting more surreal when we go into a room that turns out to be
David's Treasure Zoo and I make out with even more gold finnally saving my game
with 12,632 in gold and to very powerful pets.
